{
  "file_type": "xlsx",
  "domain": "education",
  "language": "zh",
  "title": "课后服务单位成本（示意）",
  "subtitle": "一所学校，五年，全部为假设",
  "author": "教学示例",
  "illustrative": true,
  "years": [
    "2026",
    "2027",
    "2028",
    "2029",
    "2030"
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    {
      "id": "base_students",
      "label": "期初参加人数",
      "value": 420,
      "format": "#,##0",
      "unit": "人",
      "note": "教学用例，不是某校在籍数。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    },
    {
      "id": "class_cap",
      "label": "每班上限",
      "value": 35,
      "format": "0",
      "unit": "人",
      "note": "满班才新开一班。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    },
    {
      "id": "weeks",
      "label": "教学周",
      "value": 36,
      "format": "0",
      "unit": "周",
      "note": "含考试周与否由学校自己定，此处固定。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    },
    {
      "id": "sessions",
      "label": "每周次数",
      "value": 5,
      "format": "0",
      "unit": "次",
      "note": "每个教学日一次。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    },
    {
      "id": "hours",
      "label": "每次课时",
      "value": 2,
      "format": "0.0",
      "unit": "小时",
      "note": "含延时后的一次服务。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    },
    {
      "id": "teacher_rate",
      "label": "教师课时费",
      "value": 90,
      "format": "¥#,##0",
      "unit": "元 / 小时",
      "note": "不是工资标准，是本表的输入。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    },
    {
      "id": "room_rate",
      "label": "场地每次",
      "value": 80,
      "format": "¥#,##0",
      "unit": "元 / 班次",
      "note": "含水电的包干，不拆。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    },
    {
      "id": "material",
      "label": "生均材料",
      "value": 180,
      "format": "¥#,##0",
      "unit": "元 / 人年",
      "note": "按参加人数，不按在籍人数。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    },
    {
      "id": "overhead",
      "label": "管理费比例",
      "value": 0.08,
      "format": "0.0%",
      "unit": "占直接成本",
      "note": "直接成本之外的一层。",
      "source": "情景假设"
    }
  ],
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "new_students",
      "label": "当年新增人数",
      "values": [
        0,
        30,
        30,
        30,
        30
      ],
      "format": "#,##0"
    },
    {
      "id": "students",
      "label": "参加人数",
      "expr": "prev(students)+new_students",
      "prev_base": "base_students",
      "format": "#,##0"
    },
    {
      "id": "classes",
      "label": "班数",
      "expr": "ROUNDUP(students/class_cap,0)",
      "format": "0"
    },
    {
      "id": "session_count",
      "label": "全年班次",
      "expr": "weeks*sessions",
      "format": "0"
    },
    {
      "id": "teacher",
      "label": "教师成本",
      "expr": "classes*session_count*hours*teacher_rate",
      "format": "¥#,##0"
    },
    {
      "id": "room",
      "label": "场地成本",
      "expr": "classes*session_count*room_rate",
      "format": "¥#,##0"
    },
    {
      "id": "materials",
      "label": "材料",
      "expr": "students*material",
      "format": "¥#,##0"
    },
    {
      "id": "direct",
      "label": "直接成本",
      "expr": "teacher+room+materials",
      "format": "¥#,##0"
    },
    {
      "id": "total",
      "label": "总成本",
      "expr": "direct*(1+overhead)",
      "format": "¥#,##0"
    },
    {
      "id": "unit",
      "label": "生均成本",
      "expr": "total/students",
      "format": "¥#,##0.00"
    }
  ],
  "highlights": [
    {
      "label": "2030年总成本",
      "row": "total",
      "year_index": 4,
      "format": "¥#,##0"
    },
    {
      "label": "2030年生均",
      "row": "unit",
      "year_index": 4,
      "format": "¥#,##0.00"
    },
    {
      "label": "2030年班数",
      "row": "classes",
      "year_index": 4,
      "format": "0"
    }
  ],
  "charts": [
    {
      "type": "col",
      "title": "总成本",
      "row": "total",
      "format": "¥#,##0"
    }
  ],
  "paragraphs": [
    "这是一张教学用的单位成本表，不是任何学校的预算。黄底蓝字是可以改的假设，黑字是公式。",
    "班数按每班上限向上取整。人数增加但没有越过35的整数倍时，班数不变，生均会先下降再跳升。这是表的意思，不是政策结论。"
  ],
  "caveat": "不要把生均成本写成收费标准。本表没有收入，也没有财政补助。"
}
